<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-πνέω</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-πνείω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			17.52
		</span></i>: fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πνεύσομαι</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow</i> or <i>breathe upon,
				inspire</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτας</span> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σώματι ζωήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					26p.478M.
				</span></i>
			:  —
				Pass.
			, <i>to be blown upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπνείσθω τόπος ἀπὸ βορρᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					2.27.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr.,
				<i>blow to</i> or <i>over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Vent.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμῖν . . π. αὖραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			: impers., c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἡδύ μοι
				προσέπνευσε χοιρείων κρεῶν</span> a sweet <i>savour</i>
			of pork <i>is wafted to</i> me, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				338
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>pronounce with the rough breathing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				55.23
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				141.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Seleuc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.398b
			</span></i>.</div>
